#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:1 of
msgid "Backward-fill within each group."
msgstr "在每个组内向后填充。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:3 of
msgid ""
"Propagate the next non-null value backward across consecutive nulls, "
"scoped per group.  ``limit`` caps consecutive fills per run (``None`` = "
"unlimited); ``limit <= 0`` raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"在连续的空值之间向后传播下一个非空值，按组范围划分。``limit`` 限制每次"
"运行中的连续填充数量（``None`` = 无限制）；``limit <= 0`` 会引发 ``"
"ValueError``。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:7 of
msgid "Maximum number of consecutive nulls to fill in each run."
msgstr "每次运行中要填充的最大连续空值数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:9 of
msgid "Column(s) to fill.  If None, all non-group-key columns are filled."
msgstr "要填充的列。如果为 None，则填充所有非分组键列。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:12 of
msgid ""
"Backward-filled LiteFrame with the same shape (row count preserved).  "
"Output dtypes equal the input dtypes."
msgstr ""
"具有相同形状的向后填充的 LiteFrame（保留行数）。输出数据类型等于输入"
"数据类型。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:17 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.bfill:19 of
msgid ""
"Same row-order limitation as ``ffill``: global output is in reducer/hash-"
"partition order, but intra-group order is preserved."
msgstr ""
"与 ``ffill`` 相同的行顺序限制：全局输出按 reducer/hash-分区顺序排列，但"
"组内顺序得到保留。"

